{"id":"m68752:para:fs-idp97232880","rulings":["mixture"],"maxOps":6,"en":"In the equation [[i:P[[sub:Total]]]] is the total pressure of a mixture of gases, [[i:P[[sub:A]]]] is the partial pressure of gas A; [[i:P[[sub:B]]]] is the partial pressure of gas B; [[i:P[[sub:C]]]] is the partial pressure of gas C; and so on.","is":"Í jöfnunni er [[i:P[[sub:Heildar]]]] heildarþrýstingur gasblöndu, [[i:P[[sub:A]]]] er hlutþrýstingur gass A; [[i:P[[sub:B]]]] er hlutþrýstingur gass B; [[i:P[[sub:C]]]] er hlutþrýstingur gass C; og svo framvegis."},
{"id":"m68752:caption:CNX_Chem_09_03_DaltonLaw1-caption","rulings":["mixture"],"maxOps":6,"en":"If equal-volume cylinders containing gasses at pressures of 300 kPa, 450 kPa, and 600 kPa are all combined in the same-size cylinder, the total pressure of the gas mixture is 1350 kPa.","is":"Ef gashylkjum með sama rúmmáli sem innihalda lofttegundir við 300 kPa, 450 kPa og 600 kPa þrýsting er öllum blandað saman í hylki af sömu stærð er heildarþrýstingur gasblöndunnar 1350 kPa."},
{"id":"m68752:para:fs-idp110759216","rulings":["mixture","mole-fraction"],"maxOps":6,"en":"The partial pressure of gas A is related to the total pressure of the gas mixture via its [[term:mole fraction ([[i:X]])|term-00004]], a unit of concentration defined as the number of moles of a component of a solution divided by the total number of moles of all components:","is":"Hlutþrýstingur lofttegundar A tengist heildarþrýstingi gasblöndunnar með [[term:mólbroti|term-00004]] hennar ([[i:X]]), sem er styrkleikaeining skilgreind sem mólfjöldi eins efnisþáttar í lausn deilt með heildarmólfjölda allra efnisþátta:"},
{"id":"m68752:para:fs-idp75739968","rulings":["mixture","mole-fraction"],"maxOps":6,"en":"where [[i:P[[sub:A]]]], [[i:X[[sub:A]]]], and [[i:n[[sub:A]]]] are the partial pressure, mole fraction, and number of moles of gas A, respectively, and [[i:n[[sub:Total]]]] is the number of moles of all components in the mixture.","is":"þar sem [[i:P[[sub:A]]]], [[i:X[[sub:A]]]] og [[i:n[[sub:A]]]] eru hlutþrýstingur, mólbrot og mólfjöldi lofttegundar A, og [[i:n[[sub:Total]]]] er mólfjöldi allra efnisþátta í blöndunni."},
