{"id":"m68758:problem:fs-idm212848544","rulings":["kinetic-molecular-theory"],"maxOps":6,"en":"Using the postulates of the kinetic molecular theory, explain why a gas uniformly fills a container of any shape.","is":"Útskýrðu með hjálp frumsetninga hreyfiorkukenningarinnar hvers vegna gas fyllir ílát af hvaða lögun sem er."},
{"id":"m68758:solution:fs-idm161469056","rulings":["atom"],"maxOps":6,"en":"H[[sub:2]]O. Cooling slows the speeds of the He atoms, causing them to behave as though they were heavier.","is":"H[[sub:2]]O. Kæling hægir á hraða He-atómanna, sem veldur því að þau hegða sér eins og þau væru þyngri."},
{"id":"m68758:problem:fs-idm214348288","rulings":["mixture"],"maxOps":6,"en":"What is the ratio of the average kinetic energy of a SO[[sub:2]] molecule to that of an O[[sub:2]] molecule in a mixture of two gases? What is the ratio of the root mean square speeds, [[i:u]][[sub:rms]], of the two gases?","is":"Hvert er hlutfall meðalhreyfiorku SO[[sub:2]]-sameindar og O[[sub:2]]-sameindar í blöndu tveggja lofttegunda? Hvert er hlutfall meðalferningshraða, [[i:u]][[sub:rms]], lofttegundanna tveggja?"},
{"id":"m68758:problem:fs-idp4425184","rulings":["heat"],"maxOps":6,"en":"(h) A balloon flight can last about 90 minutes. If all of the fuel is burned during this time, what is the approximate rate of heat loss (in kJ/min) from the hot air in the bag during the flight?","is":"(h) Loftbelgsflug getur staðið í um 90 mínútur. Ef allt eldsneytið brennur á þessum tíma, hver er þá áætlaður hraði varmataps (í kJ/mín) frá heita loftinu í pokanum á meðan á fluginu stendur?"},
